# Lease-abstract / deal deliverable JSONs — these are transport files uploaded
# THROUGH the app (stored in the DB), not source. Keep them out of the repo so
# the stop-hook stops flagging each new one. Patterns cover both hyphen- and
# underscore-named deliverables at the repo root (the curated samples/ folder is
# intentionally tracked and unaffected).
/*-deal.json
/*-lease-abstracts.json
/*-abstracts*.json
*_lease_abstracts.json
*_deal_abstracts.json

# Portfolio validation reports — analysis deliverables (contain deal data), not source
portfolio-validation-*.md
